# What the iltiam-staging project runs (Runbook 5, docs/runbooks/05-compose-stack.md). Public: tags only, no secrets.
# Read by scripts/deploy.sh and scripts/compose.sh as a second --env-file. One NAME=value per line; comments on their
# own lines. A tag is sha-<7> or X.Y.Z, never latest. `to-confirm` marks an image that isn't published yet:
# scripts/deploy.sh refuses to deploy it.
#
# Roll back: put the previous tags back (git log -p env/staging.versions), merge, and deploy again (Runbook 5, 9.4).
#
# Every change here is a reviewed PR to main (scripts/set-version.sh writes the image line); the deploy workflow, run
# by hand on main, then deploys it. The automatic deploys of Runbook 9 are retired (2026-11-14).

# Services beyond the always-on ones (postgres, redis, cloudflared, weights-init and the AI service), separated by
# commas. backend: migrate, web, worker and beat. web: the web app (Runbook 5, section 1). Production keeps both off
# (#36). After a deploy that turns a profile off, stop its containers by hand (Runbook 5, section 9.4).
COMPOSE_PROFILES=backend,web

# sha-9ecf382: iltiam-ai-service main, commit 9ecf38271688b35f0c87ee53c77d09c54706b149; deployed automatically on 2026-11-12 (Runbook 9).
AI_API_IMAGE=ghcr.io/iltiam/iltiam-ai-api:sha-9ecf382
AI_WORKER_IMAGE=ghcr.io/iltiam/iltiam-ai-worker:sha-9ecf382

# sha-14223c2: iltiam-backend main, commit 14223c21c25d024cbeb3ba7359094ddfd8e7d86d; deployed automatically on 2026-11-12 (Runbook 9).
BACKEND_IMAGE=ghcr.io/iltiam/iltiam-backend:sha-14223c2

# sha-aa7deb6: iltiam-web main, commit aa7deb66bb0e70c96e5f060fe6088b34e6864fda; set on 2026-11-14 for the deploy workflow (run by hand).
WEB_IMAGE=ghcr.io/iltiam/iltiam-web:sha-aa7deb6
